        "question_Nkzwn7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How often should I use Smear It On?",
            "answer": "<p>Two to three times a week is the sweet spot for this mask. Because the formula contains 4% Glycolic Acid, using it more often than that isn't recommended, the mask is designed to work within that rhythm, not beyond it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_zcAym6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Won't a clay mask dry out or crack on my skin?",
            "answer": "<p>Not this one. Magnesium Aluminium Silicate, 3% Glycerine and 5% Aloe Vera keep it comfortable and spreadable for the entire 10 to 15 minute wear time, so it stays soft on your skin instead of tightening and cracking the way traditional clay masks can.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_GyjbH9": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "I have sensitive skin — can I still use a glycolic acid mask?",
            "answer": "<p>Start carefully: patch test on your inner forearm first, and try a shorter five-minute wear time for your first few uses. Avoid it on any damaged or broken skin, and make sunscreen a daily habit while you're using it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_Xy6WJB": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I really need sunscreen if I'm just using this a few times a week?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, alpha hydroxy acids like glycolic acid can make skin more sensitive to sunlight, so a broad-spectrum SPF 30 to 50 matters every day you're using this product, and for a week after your last use too.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_6gnMAw": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I use Smear It On on the same day as Rub It In serum?",
            "answer": "<p>Directionally: mask first, rinse, then continue with the rest of your routine as normal.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_YXzpAm": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does one tube last?",
            "answer": "<p>Calculable from frequency and fill size, but needs sign-off before it's stated as a specific figure on-page.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
