      "blocks": {
        "faq_item_bXLUMk": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I use Rub It In with other active ingredients like Retinol or AHAs?",
            "answer": "<p>Rub It In can be layered with other actives, but apply it first and allow 30–60 seconds before adding anything else. If you use retinol, use Rub It In in the morning and retinol at night to avoid over-stimulation. It pairs well with Vitamin C as Niacinamide and Vitamin E enhance its brightening effect.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_UxVKyX": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is this serum suitable for sensitive and acne-prone skin?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. The formula contains no alcohol, no parabens, no phthalates, and no mineral oil, all common irritants. Lactobacillus Ferment Lysate is specifically calming for reactive skin as it reduces inflammation at the microbiome level rather than triggering it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_YDDQcL": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does one 30ml bottle last?",
            "answer": "<p>At 2 drops twice daily, morning and evening, one 30ml bottle lasts approximately 3 months.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_hqFGCW": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "When will I see results?",
            "answer": "<p>Most users notice improved hydration and a visible glow within the first few days. Deeper results, reduced dark spots, fewer breakouts, refined pores, and improved texture, typically appear within 2–4 weeks of consistent AM and PM use.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_Np9Tyc": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can oily skin types skip the moisturiser and use just the serum?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. In hot or humid weather, Rub It In is lightweight enough to function as a standalone moisturiser for oily skin. Its Jojoba Oil base mimics skin's natural sebum, providing sufficient hydration without heaviness or greasiness.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_6VGL3j": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I need to use all 5 products for the serum to work?",
            "answer": "<p>Rub It In works as a standalone product. However, results are significantly better as part of the full AM:PM system, the Face Wash balances pH, the Toner opens absorption, the Serum delivers actives, and the Moisturiser seals and support the barrier. Each step multiplies the effectiveness of the next.</p>"
          }
        }
